<h1>Zanet Works</h1>
<p>Zanet Works is a workflow tool used by agencies. The company was founded in 2015 and is headquartered in Bergen. The current release is v5.11.12.</p>
<p>Plans start at $18 per seat per month, billed annually. A single workspace supports up to 250 members, and every user gets 50 GB of storage. New accounts get a free trial of 10 days.</p>
<p>The public API allows 60 requests per minute per token. Human support is available Wednesday–Saturday, 18:00–20:00 UTC.</p>
